## 4. API Endpoints (v1)

- `GET    /api/v1/health` - System health check.
- `POST   /api/v1/analyses/upload` - Upload file & start parsing.
- `GET    /api/v1/analyses` - List analyses (`isArchived: false`).
- `GET    /api/v1/analyses/:analysisId` - Get single analysis.
- `PATCH  /api/v1/analyses/:analysisId/archive` - Soft archive analysis (`isArchived: true`).
- `GET    /api/v1/analyses/:analysisId/[module]` - Module endpoints (file, yara, virustotal, iocs, mitre, behavior, sandbox, siem, incidents, cases, soar, assets, endpoints, vulnerabilities, reports, analytics).

