## 5. Phase 1 Implementation Plan (IN PROGRESS)

Scope of Phase 1:
1. Greenfield project setup in `d:\soc 2.0` (backend, frontend, root environment configs).
2. NestJS initialization with TypeScript, `@nestjs/config`, `class-validator`, `class-transformer`.
3. Prisma ORM initialization with MySQL database connection setup (`schema.prisma`).
4. Next.js initialization with Tailwind CSS, React, TypeScript.
5. Health Module implementation (`GET /api/v1/health`).
6. Environment files setup (`.env.example`, `.env`).
7. Build and runtime verification:
   - Database connection check.
   - Prisma schema validation & migration.
   - NestJS build & startup test (`GET /api/v1/health` verification).
   - Next.js build & startup check.

*No upload handlers or SOC modules will be implemented in Phase 1.*
